flowchart TB
    Q([Treasury Bulletin question]) --> P{{Planner: emit JSON plan}}
    P --> E[Execute steps via document tools]
    E --> Store[(Task state:<br/>plan + results)]
    Store --> I{Enough evidence?}
    I -->|no, re-plan| P
    I -->|yes| S{{Synthesize answer}}
    S --> Out([Answer + FINAL_ANSWER])
